OL,3,GNEWSAFour men arrested after town
OL,4,Acentre stabbings
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour people have been arrested after
OL,7,Fthree people were stabbed and another
OL,8,Fwas beaten unconscious in a town
OL,9,Fcentre.
OL,11,FNorthamptonshire Police said officers
OL,12,Fand paramedics were called to Gold
OL,13,FStreet in Kettering at about 20:35 BST
OL,14,Ffollowing reports a 30-year-old woman
OL,15,Fhad been stabbed outside The Peacock
OL,16,Fpub.
OL,18,FThe force said they then found two men
OL,19,Fwho had also been stabbed and a third
OL,20,Fman lying unconscious in the road near
OL,21,Fthe entrance to Newlands Shopping
OL,22,FCentre.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
