OL,3,GNEWSAFour men arrested after town
OL,4,Acentre stabbings
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe four injured people were taken to
OL,7,FKettering General Hospital where one
OL,8,Findividual had surgery. The suspects
OL,9,Fwere arrested on suspicion of assault
OL,10,Fand affray.
